# Collapse the several spellings of one person into one name.
# git log/shortlog/blame and anything using %aN read this; GitHub's web UI
# does not. Machine-local: wired up with `git config --global mailmap.file`.

# Local commits are authored as "Gaurgle"; GitHub stamps web merge commits
# with the profile name. Display both as the profile name.
